OL,3,CConcern over plans to remove beds from
OL,4,Cmost hospitals in health board
OL,6,FThousands of people have signed a
OL,7,Fpetition opposing plans to remove
OL,8,Finpatient beds from all but two
OL,9,Fcommunity hospitals in Powys.
OL,11,FCritics of the proposals have argued
OL,12,Fthat residents would be forced to
OL,13,Ftravel further to access inpatient
OL,14,Fcare, with services concentrated in
OL,15,FBrecon and Newtown.
OL,17,FA petition against the potential cuts,
OL,18,Flaunched by the Welsh Liberal
OL,19,FDemocrats, has been signed by more
OL,20,Fthan 4,000 people, prompting a series
OL,21,Fof public meetings.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/7
