OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F433A1786106904
OL,3,CConcern over plans to remove beds from
OL,4,Cmost hospitals in health board
OL,6,FPowys Teaching Health Board said that
OL,7,Fit expects to launch a formal public
OL,8,Fconsultation later this year.
OL,10,FOne woman in Ystradowen has described
OL,11,Fthe proposed cuts as "extremely
OL,12,Fconcerning".
OL,14,FSally Snelling said she was able to
OL,15,Fregularly visit her late mum, who had
OL,16,FAlzheimer's disease, in Ystradgynlais
OL,17,FCommunity Hospital for six weeks
OL,18,Fbecause she had access to an inpatient
OL,19,Fbed.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/7
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,434,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F433A1786106904
OL,3,CConcern over plans to remove beds from
OL,4,Cmost hospitals in health board
OL,6,FSally told ITV Wales: "It was good
OL,7,Fbecause it's so close, if the bed had
OL,8,Fbeen in Morriston or Swansea, it would
OL,9,Fhave been a trek and added to the
OL,10,Fstress.
OL,12,F"It made my mum's life better too
OL,13,Fbecause without with that contact, as
OL,14,Fwe could go everyday, she would have
OL,15,Fforgotten us very quickly.
OL,17,F"I think the cuts would be extremely
OL,18,Fconcerning because it's the start of a
OL,19,Fvery slippery slope.
OL,26,@nD@WOUtD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/7
