OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,434,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F433A1786106904
OL,3,CConcern over plans to remove beds from
OL,4,Cmost hospitals in health board
OL,6,F"It's just going to make other things
OL,7,Fmore expensive because then you are
OL,8,Fgoing to have to have ambulances that
OL,9,Ftake you from Powys all the way to
OL,10,FSwansea, and we don't have the GP
OL,11,Fresources up here to cope with it."
OL,13,FAdrian Osborne, Deputy Director of
OL,14,FPowys Teaching Health Board, said:
OL,15,F"Later this year we expect to launch a
OL,16,Fformal public consultation on options
OL,17,Ffor the future.
OL,26,@wD@AOU
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/7
