OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,434,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F433A1786106904
OL,3,CConcern over plans to remove beds from
OL,4,Cmost hospitals in health board
OL,6,F"We will ensure that information is
OL,7,Fshared widely across the county and
OL,8,Fencourage everyone with an interest in
OL,9,Fthe future of health care in Powys to
OL,10,Flook at the evidence, consider the
OL,11,Foptions, and share their views, so
OL,12,Fthat the health board can take full
OL,13,Faccount of them before any decisions
OL,14,Fare made.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G5/7
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
