OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,434,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F433A1786106904
OL,3,CConcern over plans to remove beds from
OL,4,Cmost hospitals in health board
OL,6,F"We want to judge our success by how
OL,7,Fmany people we help to stay well
OL,8,Fenough to avoid needing a hospital
OL,9,Fbed. We want inpatient services in
OL,10,FPowys to offer better health care, so
OL,11,Fthat fewer people need to go to a
OL,12,FDistrict General Hospital.
OL,14,F"This is particularly important in a
OL,15,Flarge rural county like Powys, given
OL,16,Fthe growing needs of our ageing
OL,17,Fpopulation."
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOU
