PN,43307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F433A1786106904
OL,3,CConcern over plans to remove beds from
OL,4,Cmost hospitals in health board
OL,6,FThe Welsh Government said local
OL,7,Fservice decisions lie with the health
OL,8,Fboard, which is "best placed" to
OL,9,Fassess the needs of its population.
OL,11,FIn a statement, the Welsh Government
OL,12,Fsaid: "Powys Teaching Health Board is
OL,13,Fat a very early, preliminary stage of
OL,14,Fconsidering options and no decisions
OL,15,Fhave been made.
OL,17,F"Should there be any proposed service
OL,18,Fchanges they must be subject to
OL,19,Fappropriate engagement and
OL,20,Fconsultation with patients, staff,
OL,21,Flocal communities, and stakeholders."
OL,26,@}D@eO]
